24,"_18751":31800,"_5":22248,"_15096":24,"_1571":31801},[],"Guía de despliegue e instalación de la plataforma Lamassu IoT",{"_7914":26,"_22115":24,"_5":22253,"_18751":31803,"_15096":31804,"_1571":31805},[],"/docs/despliegue#onprem--selfmanaged--kubernetes","OnPrem & SelfManaged · Kubernetes",{"_7914":27,"_22115":24,"_5":22253,"_18751":31807,"_15096":31808,"_1571":31755},[],"/docs/despliegue#cloud--aws-ec2--aws-marketplace",{"_7914":28,"_22115":24,"_5":22253,"_18751":31810,"_15096":31811,"_1571":31812},[],"/docs/despliegue#saas--basada-en-suscripción","SaaS · Basada en suscripción",{"_7914":29,"_22115":24,"_18751":31814,"_5":22248,"_15096":24,"_1571":31815},[],"Bienvenido a la guía de **Despliegue de Lamassu IoT**. Selecciona la modalidad que mejor se adapta a tu infraestructura.",{"_7914":30,"_22115":24,"_18751":31817,"_5":22248,"_15096":31804,"_1571":31818},[],"<Card title=\"Introducción\" description=\"Requisitos y arquitectura para despliegue en Kubernetes propio\" href=\"/docs/despliegue/onprem\" />",{"_7914":31,"_22115":24,"_18751":31820,"_5":22248,"_15096":31804,"_1571":31821},[],"<Card title=\"Fastlane\" description=\"Despliegue rápido y automatizado con el script Fastlane\" href=\"/docs/despliegue/onprem/fastlane\" />",{"_7914":32,"_22115":24,"_18751":31823,"_5":22248,"_15096":31808,"_1571":31824},[],"<Card title=\"AWS EC2 · AWS Marketplace\" description=\"Lanza Lamassu IoT en AWS con un clic desde el Marketplace\" href=\"/docs/despliegue/cloud\" />",{"_7914":33,"_22115":24,"_18751":31826,"_5":22248,"_15096":31811,"_1571":31827},[],"<Card title=\"SaaS · Suscripción\" description=\"Plataforma totalmente gestionada por LKS Next, sin infraestructura propia\" href=\"/docs/despliegue/saas\" />",{"_7914":34,"_22115":34,"_5":22243,"_1571":31829,"_22256":31830,"_18751":31831,"_15096":34},"Fastlane",[31753,31754,31805],[],{"_7914":35,"_22115":34,"_18751":31833,"_5":22248,"_15096":34,"_1571":31834},[],"Referencia del script scripts/lamassu-fast-lane.sh para desplegar 